Third-party assets bundled in this repository are NOT covered by the MIT
licence above; each keeps its own licence:

- `public/textures/**` — screenshots of the Spore products
  (github.com/Offblink/Spore, /Spore-Mobile, /Spore-GUI). Content is fictional
  demo data; the UI belongs to those repositories.
- `public/audio/sfx/**` — Freesound, CC0 / CC BY as listed per file in
  `public/audio/sfx/FREESOUND-CREDITS.md` and `audio-manifest.json`.
- `public/audio/bgm/house-vibez.mp3` — Mixkit, see
  `public/audio/BGM-ATTRIBUTION.md`.
- `src/lib/PageCam.tsx` and parts of `assets/` follow the video-shotcraft
  template (Apache-2.0, github.com/Vincentwei1021/video-shotcraft).
- Rendered video is produced with Remotion, which has its own licence
  (free for individuals and small teams, commercial use may require a licence).
